gpu-switcher (0.1.0-23) unstable; urgency=low

  * Selection now mirrors the configured state: the radio selection is the
    configured card when known, otherwise auto; "Reset to auto" works when
    no GPUs are detected.
  * Journal read failures are reported separately from an unknown running
    primary.
  * Packaging: ship gpu_switcher/selection.py (was missing from the .deb);
    both build paths install the same file list; the .deb version is read
    from debian/control.

